  "releaseNotes": "Kazo OS 3.6.0-preview.1, changes for app developers:\n- The connect dialog names the server a provider will reach. When a drive type marks a field as the server address (ADR 0284), Connect a network drive writes \"This provider will reach <host>.\" before saving, and refuses an address the OS cannot allow (http, a user name or password in the URL, an IP address, localhost) with the reason. KazoNetworkDriveField.IsServerAddress tells apps which field it is.\nRelease notes: https://github.com/Kazo-ca/Os/releases/tag/v3.6.0-preview.1",
